  "practice": [
    "Say ঔ three times with an approximate ou/ow sound: ou, ou, ou.",
    "Practice ঔ-কার: ক + ৌ = কৌ, চ + ৌ = চৌ, দ + ৌ = দৌ, and ন + ৌ = নৌ.",
    "Use the reading shortcut ৌ → ou/ow in নৌকা, দৌড়, কৌতুক, and মৌমাছি.",
    "Read নৌকা as nouka, দৌড় as dour, and মৌমাছি as moumachi."
  ],
  "notes": [
    "ঔ is a Bengali vowel with an approximate ou/ow sound, depending on the word.",
    "When ঔ combines with a consonant, it uses the ৌ vowel sign, called ঔ-কার.",
    "Words using ঔ or ৌ are much less common than words using vowels such as অ, আ, ই, এ, and ও.",
    "ঔষধ is an established spelling for medicine, but ওষুধ is much more useful in everyday Bengali."
  ]
